                        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;&lt;justify&gt;This Data Analysis Software is designed to&lt;br/&gt;provide users with a simple yet powerful tool&lt;br/&gt;for performing basic statistical analysis and&lt;br/&gt;data visualization. It supports common&lt;br/&gt;statistical tests like Z-test, T-test&lt;br/&gt;(one-sample and two-sample), and calculates&lt;br/&gt;descriptive statistics such as mean, median,&lt;br/&gt;mode, and skewness.&lt;/justify&gt;&lt;/html&gt;"/>
                        <Property name="horizontalTextPosition" type="int" value="0"/>
